-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data (not covered by the licence above)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The data loaded by this project is NOT part of this repository. It is
downloaded at run time from Statbel (Belgian statistical office) open data,
published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://statbel.fgov.be/en/open-data. Every table produced by the pipeline
carries the attribution "Source: Statbel open data, CC BY 4.0".
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Statbel.
